msgctxt "error"
msgid "Account info refresh failed, check your connection and try again"
msgstr ""
"Usasishaji wa taarifa za akaunti umeshindikana. Angalia muunganisho wako na "
"ujaribu tena"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "An unknown error occurred"
msgstr "Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Authentication denied"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji umenyimwa"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Device disconnected"
msgstr "Kifaa kimetenganishwa"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Enter a valid IPv4 or IPv6 address"
msgstr "Weka anwani sahihi ya IPv4 au IPv6"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Incorrect 2FA code."
msgstr "Msimbo wa Uthibitishaji wa Hatua Mbili si sahihi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Incorrect credentials."
msgstr "Vitambulisho vya kuingia si sahihi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Invalid username."
msgstr "Jina la mtumiaji si sahihi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Looks like your system clock is out of sync.\n"
"This may cause issues when connecting to VPN.\n"
"Update your system time and try to connect again."
msgstr ""
"Inaonekana saa ya mfumo wako haijapangwa ipasavyo.\n"
"Hii inaweza kusababisha matatizo wakati wa kuunganishwa kwa VPN.\n"
"Sasisha muda wa mfumo wako kisha ujaribu tena kuunganisha."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Our servers are not reachable. Please check your internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Seva zetu hazipatikani kwa sasa. Tafadhali angalia muunganisho wako wa "
"intaneti."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Proton VPN could not connect to the VPN and blocked access to Internet to protect your IP.\n"
"\n"
"Click \"Cancel Connection\" to restore your Internet connection. If the issue persists please try to sign out and in."
msgstr ""
"Proton VPN haikuweza kuunganishwa kwa VPN na imezuia ufikiaji wa intaneti kulinda IP yako.\n"
"\n"
"Bonyeza \"Ghairi Muunganisho\" ili kurudisha muunganisho wako wa intaneti. Ikiwa tatizo linaendelea, jaribu kuondoka na kuingia tena."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Proton services could not be reached.\n"
"Please try again."
msgstr ""
"Huduma za Proton hazikuweza kufikiwa.\n"
"Tafadhali jaribu tena."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Session limit reached"
msgstr "Kikomo cha kipindi kimefikiwa"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Something went wrong. Please try submitting your report at:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kuna kilichokwenda vibaya. Tafadhali jaribu kutuma taarifa yako kwenye:\n"

msgctxt "error"
msgid "There is not enough space left on your device."
msgstr "Hakuna nafasi ya kutosha iliyobaki kwenye kifaa chako."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "Muda umeisha."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Tunnel setup failed"
msgstr "Usanidi wa tuneli haukuweza kukamilika"

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication failed. Security key 2FA is not enabled for your "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa vipengele viwili haukufanikiwa. Uthibitishaji wa Hatua "
"Mbili wa ufunguo wa usalama haujawashwa kwa akaunti yako."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed: Incorrect PIN"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji wa vipengele viwili haukufanikiwa: PIN si sahihi."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed: No security key detected"
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa vipengele viwili haukufanikiwa: Ufunguo wa usalama "
"haujagundulika."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication failed: The security key you used is not linked to"
" your Proton Account."
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa vipengele viwili haukufanikiwa: Ufunguo wa usalama "
"uliotumia haujaunganishwa na Akaunti yako ya Proton."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Two-factor authentication failed: Your security key has no PIN set"
msgstr ""
"Uthibitishaji wa vipengele viwili haukufanikiwa: Ufunguo wako wa usalama "
"haujawekewa PIN."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "Unable to sign out, please ensure you have internet access."
msgstr "Hukuweza kuondoka, tafadhali hakikisha una upatikanaji wa intaneti."

msgctxt "error"
msgid "We're sorry, an unexpected error occurred. Please try again."
msgstr "Samahani, hitilafu isiyotarajiwa imetokea. Tafadhali jaribu tena."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"You are connected to the VPN, but all traffic is blocked.\n"
"You need to go to the authentication page provided by security and authenticate with your hardware key.\n"
"After that, the traffic will be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Umeunganishwa kwa VPN, lakini trafiki yote imezuiwa.\n"
"Unahitaji kwenda kwenye ukurasa wa uthibitishaji unaotolewa na usalama na kuthibitisha kwa ufunguo wako wa maunzi.\n"
"Baada ya hapo, trafiki itawashwa."

msgctxt "error"
msgid ""
"You've reached your maximum device limit. To reconnect to VPN, please "
"disconnect from another device."
msgstr ""
"Umefikia kikomo chako cha juu cha vifaa. Ili kuunganisha tena kwenye VPN, "
"tafadhali tenganisha kifaa kingine."

