msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Access preferred connections from system tray. Enter country or server "
"codes, separated by commas, to quickly connect (e.g.: NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."
msgstr ""
"Fikia miunganisho unayopendelea kutoka kwenye trei ya mfumo. Weka misimbo ya"
" nchi au seva, zikitenganishwa na koma, ili kuunganisha haraka (kwa mfano: "
"NL#42, JP, US, IT#01)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Account info refreshed, restart the app to see changes"
msgstr ""
"Taarifa za akaunti zimesasishwa. Anzisha upya programu ili kuona mabadiliko."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Active port is {new_port}"
msgstr "Mlango unaotumika ni {new_port}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Allow selected apps to connect without VPN protection."
msgstr "Ruhusu programu zilizochaguliwa kuunganishwa bila ulinzi wa VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Automatically disconnect from the internet if VPN connection is lost."
msgstr ""
"Kata muunganisho wa intaneti moja kwa moja ikiwa muunganisho wa VPN "
"umepotea."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been disabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Ufikiaji wa Beta umezimwa.\n"
"Tafadhali anzisha upya programu ili mabadiliko yaanze kutumika."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Beta access has been enabled.\n"
"Please restart the app for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Ufikiaji wa Beta umewashwa.\n"
"Tafadhali anzisha upya programu ili mabadiliko yaanze kutumika."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Bypass firewalls to connect to P2P servers and devices on your local "
"network. "
msgstr ""
"Pita ngome ili kuunganisha kwa seva za P2P na vifaa kwenye mtandao wako wa "
"ndani. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Captures a specific issue you're facing when using Proton VPN to get help from our customer support team.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: This file is a recording of all your internet activity during the capture session."
msgstr ""
"Hurekodi tatizo mahususi unalokumbana nalo unapotumia Proton VPN ili kupata usaidizi kutoka kwa timu yetu ya huduma kwa wateja.\n"
"\n"
"Onyo: Faili hii ni rekodi ya shughuli zako zote za mtandao wakati wa kipindi cha kurekodi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Connect to Proton VPN using your own domain name servers (DNS)."
msgstr "Unganisha kwa Proton VPN ukitumia seva zako za majina ya kikoa (DNS)."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to a Tor server to access hidden services and onion sites using any "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Unganisha kwenye seva ya Tor ili kufikia huduma zilizofichwa na tovuti za "
"onion kwa kutumia kivinjari chochote."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Connect to your destination server through a second, maximum security VPN "
"server. Slower, but more private."
msgstr ""
"Unganisha kwenye seva yako ya marudio kupitia seva ya pili ya VPN yenye "
"usalama wa hali ya juu kabisa. Ni polepole zaidi, lakini ya faragha zaidi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Copied!"
msgstr "Imenakiliwa!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Crash reports help us fix bugs, detect firewalls, and avoid VPN blocks.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Ripoti za hitilafu za programu hutusaidia kurekebisha kasoro, kugundua ngome, na kuepuka vizuizi vya VPN.\n"
"\n"
"Takwimu hizi hazina anwani yako ya IP, na haziwezi kutumika kukutambua. Hatuzishiriki kamwe na wahusika wengine."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Customize your connection by deciding which apps are protected by VPN."
msgstr ""
"Sanidi muunganisho wako kwa kubaini ni programu zipi zinalindwa na VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Disables randomization of the local addresses mapping. This can slightly "
"reduce connection security, but should allow direct connections for online "
"gaming and similar purposes."
msgstr ""
"Inazima nasibu wa ramani ya anwani za ndani. Hii inaweza kupunguza kidogo "
"usalama wa muunganisho, lakini inapaswa kuruhusu miunganisho ya moja kwa "
"moja kwa michezo ya mtandaoni na madhumuni mengine kama hayo."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Disabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Inazima Ufikiaji wa Beta..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Each code can only be used once"
msgstr "Kila msimbo unaweza kutumika mara moja tu."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Enabling Beta access..."
msgstr "Inawasha Ufikiaji wa Beta..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Free-tier launches default to a Proton protocol. Any WireGuard or OpenVPN "
"selection lasts only until the next application restart."
msgstr ""
"Vianzisho vya kiwango cha bure hutumia itifaki ya Proton kwa chaguo-msingi. "
"Uchaguzi wowote wa WireGuard au OpenVPN hudumu hadi tu programu inapowashwa "
"upya."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Get early access and help us test new versions of Proton VPN."
msgstr ""
"Pata ufikiaji wa mapema na utusaidie kujaribu matoleo mapya ya Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "If your security key has a button or a gold disc, tap it now."
msgstr "Ikiwa ufunguo wako wa usalama una kitufe au diski ya dhahabu, uguse."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Increase your connection speed by up to 400% with performance enhancing "
"technologies."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza kasi ya muunganisho wako kwa hadi 400% kwa kutumia teknolojia "
"zinazoimarisha utendaji."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Insert the U2F or FIDO key linked to your Proton Account. "
msgstr ""
"Ongeza ufunguo wa U2F au FIDO uliounganishwa na Akaunti yako ya Proton. "

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to disable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Haikuwezekana kuzima Ufikiaji wa Beta.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "It was not possible to enable Beta access.\n"
msgstr "Haikuwezekana kuwasha Ufikiaji wa Beta.\n"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "Kizima cha dharura kinaweza kubadilishwa tu VPN ikiwa imetenganishwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Kill switch is blocking any outgoing connections."
msgstr "Kizima cha dharura kinauzuia miunganisho yote ya kutoka nje."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Kill switch selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Haiwezi kuchagua kizima cha dharura wakati VPN inatumika. Tenganisha ili "
"kufanya mabadiliko."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Loading app..."
msgstr "Inapakia programu..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Multiple security keys were found. Tap one to select it."
msgstr "Vifunguo vingi vya usalama vilipatikana. Gusa kimoja uchague."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only allow internet access when connected to Proton VPN. Advanced kill "
"switch will remain active even when you restart your device."
msgstr ""
"Ruhusu ufikiaji wa intaneti ukiwa umeunganishwa kwa Proton VPN pekee. Kizima"
" cha dharura cha hali ya juu kitaendelea kuwaka hata ukianzisha upya kifaa "
"chako."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Only selected apps connect with VPN protection. All other traffic is "
"unprotected."
msgstr ""
"Programu zilizochaguliwa pekee ndizo zinazounganishwa kwa ulinzi wa VPN. "
"Trafiki yote mingine haikalindwi."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Permanent Kill Switch is blocking any outgoing connections and preventing your IP to be exposed.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to disable Kill Switch?"
msgstr ""
"Kizima cha dharura cha kudumu kinauzuia miunganisho yote ya kutoka nje na kuzuia IP yako kufichuliwa.\n"
"\n"
"Je, unataka kuzima kizima cha dharura?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Please establish a new VPN connection for changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Tafadhali anza muunganisho mpya wa VPN ili mabadiliko yaanze kutumika."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protect yourself from ads, malware, and trackers on websites and apps."
msgstr ""
"Jilinde kutokana na matangazo, programu hasidi, na vifuatiliaji kwenye "
"tovuti na programu."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protects your IP address by disconnecting you from the internet if you lose "
"your VPN connection. {learn_more}"
msgstr ""
"Inalinda anwani yako ya IP kwa kukutenganisha na intaneti ukipoteza "
"muunganisho wako wa VPN. {learn_more}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Protocol can only be changed when VPN is disconnected."
msgstr "Itifaki inaweza kubadilishwa tu wakati VPN haijaunganishwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Protocol selection is disabled while VPN is active. Disconnect to make "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Kuchagua itifaki kimezimwa wakati VPN inafanya kazi. Tenganisha ili kufanya "
"mabadiliko."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Kufunga programu kutaghairi muunganisho wa sasa wa VPN.\n"
"\n"
"Je, ungependa kuendelea?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Quitting the application will keep the kill switch active, but your current VPN connection will be terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Kizima cha dharura kitaendelea kufanya kazi unapofunga programu, lakini muunganisho wako wa sasa wa VPN utakatizwa.\n"
"\n"
"Je, ungependa kuendelea?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Reporting your issue..."
msgstr "Inaripoti tatizo lako..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing in..."
msgstr "Inaingia..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection and disable the kill switch.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Kutoka kutaghairi muunganisho wa sasa wa VPN na kuzima kizima cha dharura.\n"
"\n"
"Je, ungependa kuendelea?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will cancel the current VPN connection.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Kutoka kutaghairi muunganisho wa sasa wa VPN.\n"
"\n"
"Je, ungependa kuendelea?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Signing out will disable the kill switch, potentially exposing your internet traffic. \n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Kutoka kutasababisha kizima cha dharura kuzimwa, na hivyo kuweza kufichua trafiki yako ya mtandao. \n"
"\n"
"Je, ungependa kuendelea?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Signing out..."
msgstr "Inatoka..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Some required components were not detected on your system. The app may not "
"work as expected."
msgstr ""
"Baadhi ya vipengele vinavyohitajika havikutambuliwa kwenye mfumo wako. "
"Huenda programu isifanye kazi inavyotarajiwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Split tunneling enabled. Remember to restart affected apps."
msgstr ""
"Mgawanyo wa trafiki umewashwa. Kumbuka kuanzisha upya programu "
"zilizoathiriwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"These servers give the best performance for BitTorrent and file sharing."
msgstr "Seva hizi hutoa utendaji bora kwa BitTorrent na kushiriki faili."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"This technology allows Proton VPN to provide higher speed and security in "
"difficult-to-reach countries."
msgstr ""
"Teknolojia hii huwezesha Proton VPN kutoa kasi zaidi na usalama katika nchi "
"ngumu kufikia."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will automatically set your protocol to WireGuard."
msgstr "Hii itaweka itifaki yako kuwa WireGuard moja kwa moja."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable NetShield."
msgstr "Hii itazima NetShield."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable custom DNS."
msgstr "Hii itazima DNS maalum."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable kill switch."
msgstr "Hii itazima kizima cha dharura."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "This will disable split tunneling."
msgstr "Hii itazima mgawanyo wa trafiki."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Tunnels IPv6 traffic through the VPN. Can enhance compatibility with IPv6 "
"networks."
msgstr ""
"Inapitisha trafiki ya IPv6 kupitia VPN. Inaweza kuboresha utangamano na "
"mitandao ya IPv6."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"Usage data helps us overcome VPN blocks and improve app performance.\n"
"\n"
"These statistics do not contain your IP address, and they cannot be used to identify you. We'll never share them with third parties."
msgstr ""
"Takwimu za matumizi hutusaidia kuvuka vizuizi vya VPN na kuboresha utendaji wa programu.\n"
"\n"
"Takwimu haziwei anwani yako ya IP, na haziwezi kutumika kukutambua. Hatushawahi kuzishirikisha na wahusika wengine."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "When enabled, the app starts minimized to the tray."
msgstr "Inapowashwa, programu inaanza ikiwa imepunguzwa kwenye trei."

msgctxt "message"
msgid ""
"You will be connected to a server as soon as Proton VPN app starts. Replace "
"it with a country ISO code (e.g.: US for United States), a server (e.g.: "
"NL#42) or Fastest for quick connection. Default value: Off."
msgstr ""
"Utaunganishwa kwenye seva mara programu ya Proton VPN inapoanza. Badilisha "
"na msimbo wa ISO wa nchi (kwa mfano: US kwa Marekani), seva (kwa mfano: "
"NL#42) au Fastest kwa muunganisho wa haraka. Thamani ya chaguo-msingi: "
"Imezimwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your feedback helps us improve Proton VPN."
msgstr "Maoni yako hutusaidia kuboresha Proton VPN."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your issue has been reported"
msgstr "Tatizo lako limeripotiwa."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "Your session has expired. Please sign in again."
msgstr "Kipindi chako kimeisha. Tafadhali ingia tena."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "{learn_more} about requirements and alternative installation methods."
msgstr "{learn_more} kuhusu mahitaji na njia mbadala za kusakinisha."

